        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Great school and great teachers",
        "time": 1695656899,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Cass Vilo",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103903541260705005734/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWYFfwVdzEpKRtFprJkFWEOFqt2Zxfr_qxehINzAlkHDiuTqgQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I danced at this school for several years during my childhood, and I returned to ballet as an adult. I am honestly delighted with my experience! Not only are there few adult classes in the area, but the ones offered here are of high quality. You feel like you are working hard and really making progress. In short, I highly recommend this dance school!",
        "time": 1734751102,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Michel Archambault",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106827555528498563229/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWyyGJhxAtYkyz0WeIW4eQNobRW-auvAw3pYOJIeCJUnNMJwL68=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "My daughter thoroughly enjoys the classical ballet classes she's been taking there for the past five years.\nThe end-of-year show and the Nutcracker performance, held every other December, are unforgettable moments for the children.",
        "time": 1733881061,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nicole T",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104972247427339609723/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIlW9dZX_Qbb1Ghl9Te3XpWgzfkmcSbGpsmh_n4D6-udUqhnyk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I love my classes with Manon; she's very attentive and always gives constructive feedback. It's refreshing to have adult ballet classes with serious (but fun!) instruction.",
        "time": 1733886463,
        "translated": true
      }
